- **Services**: `ApiService` (`get(endpoint, queryParams)`, `post(endpoint, body)`; PUT/DELETE sent as POST), `ToastService` (`success`/`error`/`info`/`warning`), `ChipNavigationService.addTab({title, route})`, `AuthService.ScreenName`, `AuthService.getEmployeeId()` (reads `localStorage.employeeId`).
