- **`HRMS_FrontEnd/src/app/module/canteen-management/meal-session/meal-session-list/*`** and **`menu-plan/menu-plan-form/*`** — the idiom for list screens (CommonGrid) and form screens (form-card + Bootstrap rows + DevExtreme controls).
